 "note": "XS, 13 platforms. A strait runs down the middle; ONE ferry serves its three crossings and sits on the top, middle, bottom, middle lane in turn (time your send to the lane it is heading for). The only dry way over is the top stone (T) - its owner can retract the outer roads into it (S decks, both sides at once). Belts push each home's middle road toward the strait. Finale: the two banks, split by the ferry.",
 "geometricSymmetry": true,
